# Both Dockerfiles COPY only ocrd-rust/ and attestor/. Everything else in this
# checkout (benchmarks, profiles, sibling toolchains, local build output) sent
# ~7.4GB of context per build; exclude it so the daemon receives what it uses.
*
!ocrd-rust
!attestor
ocrd-rust/target
ocrd-rust/target-*
ocrd-rust/bin
attestor/attestor/node_modules
